      },
      "message": "ci(post-merge): raise the batch gate step limit to 75 minutes\n\nThe step \"Batch gate tier\" stopped at 45 minutes. After PR #3363 added\nwgpu and the crate camcraft-gpu, each runner must build app, gpu and ui\nfrom a cold state one time. That build did not finish in 45 minutes\n(runs 45045638947 and 45046106061), so no test ran.\n\nThe step limit is now 75 minutes and the check in \"Gate summary\" is\n74. The job limit of 90 minutes and the xtask watchdog do not change.\n\nFixes #3535\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
