      "message": "ci(post-merge): pin the 75-minute step limit in the xtask test and the process texts\n\nThe workflow step limit is now 75 minutes. The test\nxtask/tests/post_merge_stall.rs pinned the old 45, and AGENTS.md and the\nrunners skill named it. All three now say 75. The decision file\ndocs/decisions/3535-post-merge-step-limit.md records the choice.\n\nRefs #3535\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
